-----------------------------------------------------------------------
March 13, 2003: annotate - locuslinkByID and locuslinkQuery now have
    a parameter "browse=TRUE".  If TRUE (default), the behaviour is as
    it was before.  If FALSE, the user's browser does not open up on
    the URL constructed, but rather will return the URL 
    acquired.  JG

